  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform current is flowing along the length dinfinite, straight. thin. hollow cylinder dradius $R$ The magnetic field $B$ produced at perpendicular distance $d$ from the axis of the cylinder is plotied in a graph. Which of the following figures looks like the plot?",
