  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\because$ Magnetic field due to a hollow cylinder of radius $r$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2018_phy_a27.png\">\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\nB_{\\text {inside }} &=0(\\text { for } d < r) \\\\\r\nB_{\\text {outside }} &=\\frac{\\mu_{0}}{2 \\pi} \\cdot \\frac{i}{d}(\\text { for } d \\geq r)\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\r\nSo, graph between $B$ and $d$.<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2018_phy_a27a.png\">",
    "image": null
